* Morpho Blue
** Markets
*** Loan, collateral, oracle, IRM, LLTV
*** Id = keccak256(params)
*** Permissionless, immutable
*** Isolated accounting
** Owner
*** Enable IRMs and LLTVs
*** Fee <= 25% of interest
*** No pause, no upgrade
** Shares and interest
*** Supply and borrow shares
*** 1e6 virtual shares, 1 virtual asset
*** Rounding favours protocol
*** Lazy accrual, Taylor series
left side
** Health and liquidation
*** Debt <= collateral x price x LLTV
*** LIF = min(1.15, 1/(1 - 0.3(1 - LLTV)))
*** No close factor
** Bad debt
*** Written off when collateral = 0
*** Shared by market suppliers
*** Oracle drop < LLTV x LIF
** Developer features
*** Callbacks before transferFrom
*** Free flash loans
*** Authorizations, EIP-712
